\n\
Turn 1 play: Boiling Rock Prison enters tapped, so it would be tapped on turn 1 but untaps turn 2 and can produce B or R. Actually, if I play Boiling Rock Prison on turn 1, it enters tapped, so I can't use it this turn, but it untaps for turn 2. That's good — it effectively doesn't cost me anything since I have no turn-1 play.\n\
\n\
