\n\
Actually let's think: Turn 2, I play a land — if I play Island, I have B and U available: {B} from prison and {U} from island — that's 2 mana for either Corrupt Court Official or Forecasting Fortune Teller.\n\
\n\
Plan: Turn 1 play Boiling Rock Prison (tapped). Turn 2 play Island, cast Corrupt Court Official (make opponent discard). Or Forecasting Fortune Teller for a Clue.\n\
\n\
