      "thinking": "Let me look at the current state. It's my turn 3 postcombat main phase. I have Deadly Precision on the stack targeting Long Feng. Wait — the game state shows a Clue token still on my battlefield (p36, untapped). But the log said I sacrificed the Clue to cast Deadly Precision. Hmm, actually looking at the state: I have a Clue Token untapped on the battlefield. And Deadly Precision is on the stack targeting Long Feng.\n\
