\n\
That's a great combo. Let me think about sequencing:\n\
\n\
1. Cast Fatal Fissure targeting Long Feng ({1}{B}) — cost 2 mana.\n\
2. Cast Deadly Precision targeting Long Feng ({B} + sacrifice Clue token) — cost 1 mana + Clue.\n\
\n\
