      "reasoning": "Looking at this combat: both attackers (3/3 Swamp, 3/4 Long Feng) get through regardless of how I block — my 1/3 and 1/1 can't kill either one, so any block is a pure chump that feeds my creatures for free. Meanwhile, The Fire Nation Drill in hand kills Long Feng with its ETB next turn, so I don't need to trade resources now. I'll take the 6 and keep my full board (Teller + Official = exactly Crew 2 for the Drill later).",
      "thinking": "Let me analyze the situation. It's turn 5, opponent is attacking with:\n\
