- Corrupt Court Official 1/1 (p4)\n\
- Clue Token (p36)\n\
- Lands: Boiling Rock Prison, Island (tapped), Swamp (tapped), Swamp — 2 untapped lands\n\
\n\
My hand: Deadly Precision, Lost Days, Messenger Hawk, The Fire Nation Drill\n\
\n\
