      "reasoning": "I'm at 14 after their attack. Time to execute my plan: kill Long Feng (their value engine) while all their lands are tapped, and develop my board. I'll cast Deadly Precision using my Clue token as the sacrifice cost, then follow up with Messenger Hawk.\n\
