\n\
Actually, let me reconsider the mana. 4 untapped lands. If I cast Drill ({2}{B}{B}), I use Prison + 2 Swamps, leaving Island. Nothing to cast with Island alone. If I cast DP ({B}) + Hawk ({2}{U/B}): Prison for B, then Island(U) + Swamp + Swamp for Hawk. All 4 mana used efficiently.\n\
\n\
