\n\
Actually wait — do I want to trade? Peddlers has deathtouch and gets bigger when they sacrifice permanents (they have a Food token). Trading my 1/1 Official for their Peddlers... but my 1/1 doesn't kill the 2/2 Peddlers. Only deathtouch kills my creature. So blocking with Peddlers is pure upside for them: they kill my attacker and keep Peddlers.\n\
\n\
So attacking is bad here. Any attack gets blocked by Peddlers and I lose a creature for free.\n\
\n\
