Actually wait, even Hawk — what if they have a trick? They have 1 card in hand and 1 untapped Forest. Could be a pump spell or removal. If they kill Hawk in combat... 1 damage isn't worth risking my crew member? If Hawk dies, Teller alone can't crew (1 power < 2). Then Drill is offline until... my Peddlers can't crew while sick. So Hawk dying = Drill can't attack next turn. That's a real cost. But they have only 1 untapped Forest and 1 card. A green instant that kills a 1/2 flyer? Unlikely but possible (some fight spell? fight requires a creature — Ruffians 3/1 fighting Hawk 1/2 kills Hawk). Hmm. Risk is low but the reward (1 damage) is also low. \n\
