Kill Swamp: Their attackers: Peddlers 3/3 deathtouch, Ruffians 3/1. My Drill can't attack into Peddlers (deathtouch kills it; well, Drill tramples — if Peddlers blocks Drill 4/4: Peddlers deals 3 to Drill → Drill dies to deathtouch; Drill deals 4 to Peddlers 3/3 → Peddlers dies, 1 tramples over. Trade Drill for Peddlers. Bad.)\n\
\n\
