      "thinking": "The Fire Nation Drill's ETB trigger is asking if I want to tap it to destroy a target creature with power 4 or less. I planned to destroy the Pirate Peddlers (3/3 deathtouch) — that's the only creature that can kill my Drill in combat. Let me confirm targets:\n\
