- Pirate Peddlers 3/3 deathtouch — power 3, can be destroyed\n\
- Swamp 3/3 earthbent — power 3, can be destroyed\n\
\n\
My earlier reasoning: destroy the Pirate Peddlers because deathtouch is the only thing that can kill my Drill in combat. The earthbent Swamp, if destroyed, returns tapped — which is actually fine too, but it would come back. The Peddlersis a permanent removal.\n\
\n\
Yes, tap the Drill and destroy the Pirate Peddlers.",
