      "reasoning": "My turn 8: I have 5 untapped lands, a Clue token, and drew Swampsnare Trap (-5/-3). I need two creatures with total power 2+ to crew the Drill and hit for 4 trample, but I only have Messenger Hawk (1 power). Casting Pirate Peddlers as the second crew piece.",
      "tool_calls": [
        {
          "name": "choose_action",
          "arguments": "{\"summary\":\"Their turn 7: I traded Fortune Teller for the Ruffians, took 3 (11→8), and they played Boiling Rock Rioter (3/3 firebending) and exiled the Ruffians from their own graveyard. My turn 8: 5 untapped lands, one creature (Messenger Hawk) — I need a second body to crew the Drill. Casting Pirate Peddlers (2/2 deathtouch) as the second crew piece.\",\"choice\":\"p52\",\"rationale\":\"I need two creatures with total power 2+ to crew The Fire Nation Drill, and Messenger Hawk is only 1 power. Pirate Peddlers gives me the second crew piece plus a deathtouch blocker on defense. This turn I attack with the Hawk to grow my Clue count; next turn I crew and swing for 4 trample.\"}",
        }
