      "reasoning": "Their board is entirely tapped or summoning-sick (Rioter 3/3, two earthbent Swamps, Food token) with no flying or reach blockers, so Messenger Hawk attacks for free. I'll attack, then sacrifice my Clue token during combat — drawing a second card this turn turns the Hawk into a 3/2 via its static ability, upgrading 1 damage to 3.",
