\n\
Combat: Should I attack with Messenger Hawk? They have no flying blockers (Rioter is ground, tapped anyway; earthbent Swamps are tapped). Messenger Hawk gets +2/+0 if I've drawn two or more cards this turn — I've drawn 1 card this turn. So it's a 1/2 flyer. Attack for 1: 19→18.\n\
\n\
That's free damage. Yes, attack with Messenger Hawk.\n\
\n\
Then postcombat: I have 2 untapped Swamps. Hand: Lost Days {4}{U}, Swampsnare Trap {2}{B}. Swampsnare Trap costs {2}{B} — I only have 2 untapped Swamps = {B}{B}, can't pay {2}{B}. Can't cast anything with 2 mana... Actually wait, Swampsnare Trap is {2}{B} = 3 mana total. I have 2 untapped. Can't cast.\n\
\n\
