\n\
Let me also think about postcombat main: after combat, 2 untapped Swamps (if I don't crack clue). Nothing castable with 2 mana. So the mana is only useful for the Clue crack. So the real question is just whether to crack the clue this turn (during combat for the pump) or later.\n\
\n\
I'll attack with Hawk, then crack the Clue when I get priority in combat to make it 3/2.\n\
\n\
