\n\
Options:\n\
1. Block with Pirate Peddlers (3/3 deathtouch). It can block one attacker and kill it (deathtouch), but Peddlers would take damage: if it blocks the 3/3, Peddlers takes 3 and dies (3/3 vs 3/3, both die — Peddlers has deathtouch so it kills the Swamp, and the Swamp deals 3 to Peddlers killing it). Trade Peddlers for an earthbent Swamp — the Swamp returns tapped to the battlefield, so opponent doesn't really lose much. Bad trade.\n\
