2. Crew the Drill (tap Peddlers for crew 2), then block with the Drill. The Drill's stats: The Fire Nation Drill — what's its P/T? The oracle text shown doesn't include P/T explicitly. Let me recall: The Fire Nation Drill is a Vehicle with Trample, ETB tap and destroy creature with power 4 or less, Crew 2. I need its power/toughness. From Avatar set... The Fire Nation Drill is likely a 5/4 or similar Vehicle. Let me think — I need to check. The card reference doesn't show P/T for the Drill. Actually it shows \"The Fire Nation Drill: Trample / When {this} enters...\" — no P/T listed. For Vehicles, the P/T is usually printed. I should use get_oracle_text to check, or maybe I already know from earlier: I noted \"this also reveals its printed P/T so I can choose the optimal block.\"\n\
