Let me consider the math. I'm at 8. Opponent attacks with 3/3 and 2/2 — total 5 damage if unblocked, putting me at 3. \n\
\n\
If I crew the Drill with Peddlers (Peddlers is sick but crew doesn't care about summoning sickness — tapping a creature for crew is not a tap ability, so summoning sickness doesn't prevent it). Then the Drill becomes a creature and can block.\n\
