If the Drill is big enough (e.g., 5/4), it can block the 3/3, kill it, and survive (takes 3, has 4 toughness). Then the 2/2 gets through: I take 2, going to 6. That's decent.\n\
\n\
Alternatively, block with both Drill and Peddlers: Peddlers blocks 2/2 (kills it with deathtouch, survives — 2/2 deals 2 to Peddlers' 3 toughness, Peddlers survives), Drill blocks 3/3 (kills it, survives if toughness > 3). Then I take 0 damage! But wait — can I block with both? Peddlers is untapped (the board doesn't show it tapped). Blocking doesn't require tapping. So yes: Peddlers blocks the 2/2, Drill blocks the 3/3.\n\
