But wait — crewing the Drill requires tapping creatures with total power 2+. Peddlers has power 3. If I tap Peddlers to crew, Peddlers becomes tapped and can't block! That's the tension.\n\
\n\
So the choice is:\n\
A) Crew Drill with Peddlers → Drill is a creature, Peddlers tapped. Only Drill blocks. Drill blocks 3/3 (kills it, survives if toughness ≥ 4), 2/2 through → take 2 (8→6). Or Drill blocks 2/2, 3/3 through → take 3 (8→5).\n\
