\n\
Wait, Pirate Peddlers has summoning_sick: true. It can still block! Summoning sickness only prevents attacking and activating abilities with tap/untap symbols.\n\
\n\
So I can block with Pirate Peddlers directly. Deathtouch 3/3 blocking the 3/3 Swamp: Peddlers kills the Swamp (deathtouch), and takes 3 damage — Peddlers is 3/3, so it dies too? 3 damage to a 3/3 = dead. So Peddlers trades with the 3/3 Swamp. But the Swamp returns to the battlefield tapped when it dies (earthbend). So the trade is bad for me — I lose a real creature, they just get their land back tapped.\n\
\n\
Alternatively, block the 2/2 with Peddlers: Peddlers kills it (deathtouch), takes 2 damage, survives as a 3/3 with 2 damage marked... no wait, 3/3 with 2 damage survives (3 toughness > 2 damage). So Peddlers survives! And the 2/2 Swamp returns tapped. I take 3 from the 3/3 (8→5).\n\
\n\
