\n\
Key question: block or not?\n\
\n\
If I don't block: 8→3. Then next turn, what kills me? Opponent has Boiling Rock Rioter (3/3) + two earthbent Swamps (3/3 and 2/2, but they'll be tapped until their next untap... wait, they're lands that became creatures; they untap normally at the start of opponent's turn. They attacked this turn, so next turn they untap and can attack again).\n\
