Wait, no — it's the opponent's turn now. After this combat, they have postcombat main, then my turn. On their NEXT turn, everything untaps. So on my turn, their board: Rioter (untapped after their turn passes... no wait, permanents untap at the start of THEIR controller's turn. The Swamps attacked, so they're tapped now; they stay tapped through my turn; they untap at the start of the opponent's next turn).\n\
