      "tool_calls": [
        {
          "name": "choose_action",
          "arguments": "{\"summary\":\"My turn 8 postcombat: Lost Days tucked their 3/3 earthbent Swamp into their library (no earthbend return) and gave me a Clue token. Their board: untapped Boiling Rock Rioter 3/3, tapped 2/2 earthbent Swamp, Food token, 4 lands, 2 cards in hand. I'm at 3 life with all lands tapped, an untapped Messenger Hawk, untapped 3/3 deathtouch Pirate Peddlers, and an uncrewed Fire Nation Drill. Attacking is pure downside (a chump block kills my Hawk and removes a crew piece), so I skip combat and keep both creatures back to crew the Drill for blocking against the Rioter.\",\"choice\":\"no\"}",
        }
