      "reasoning": "The Swampsnare Trap resolved and the Buzzard-Wasp Colony is now -1/1 — it will die to state-based actions, removing their only flying blocker. This opens up a big window: with the Colony gone and their 2/2 earthbent Swamp tapped, Boiling Rock Rioter is their ONLY untapped creature. If I crack my Clue (drawing my 2nd card this turn), Foggy Swamp Hunters gains menace — and a single blocker can't stop a menace creature, making both it and my flying Hawk unblockable.\n\
