      "thinking": "The Swampsnare Trap resolved — the Buzzard-Wasp Colony is now -1/1, so it died to the -5/-3. Wait, actually it shows \"Buzzard-Wasp Colony -1/1 (sick, 2 +1/+1 counters, included in -1/1)\" — so it's still on the battlefield at -1/1? That means it's dead... actually a creature with -1 toughness dies as a state-based action. But the board still shows it. Hmm, maybe the snapshot is showing it before state-based actions? Actually the listing shows it in PilotB's battlefield still. Odd. But presumably it will die.\n\
