OK so even Line B can leave me at 1 if they flashback Rockalanche. But more likely they don't (they've had the chance... actually they only hit 6 lands this turn — they played their 6th land on turn 9/10? They have 6 lands now: 3 Forest + 3 Swamp. Turn 9 they cast Colony (4/4 flying = ~5 mana?). They might not have had 6 mana + Forests until now. Rockalanche flashback {5}{G} needs 6 mana with at least 1 Forest — they have 3 Forests. So turn 10 is the first turn they can flashback it. Hmm, wait — actually do they even want to? Earthbend 3 makes a 3/3 haste — decent.\n\
\n\
Actually wait, I should double-check: how many Forests do they control? 3 (all tapped). X = 3 → earthbend 3 → 3/3. Yes.\n\
