      "reasoning": "Combat resolved well — my lifelink Hunters gained me 3 (3→6) and opponent dropped to 5. Nothing castable with one untapped Swamp, so I'll end my turn and set up a lethal swing next turn.",
      "thinking": "Combat resolved. I went from 3 to 6 life (lifelink from Hunters gained me 3 — so Hunters dealt damage unblocked or through). Opponent went 15→5. Let me reconstruct: I attacked with Hawk 3/2 flying, Peddlers 4/4 deathtouch, Hunters 3/4 lifelink+menace. They had Rioter 3/3 and Colony -1/1 flying. Menace means Hunters needs 2 blockers; they only had 2 creatures total. They likely blocked Hawk with Colony? No — Colony is -1/1 flying, could block Hawk. Rioter blocks Peddlers? Then Hunters (menace) can't be blocked by just one... whatever happened, they're at 5 and I'm at 6.\n\
\n\
Now postcombat main: 1 untapped Swamp, hand: Sold Out {3}{B}, Swamp, Vindictive Warden {2}{B/R}. Can't cast anything with 1 Swamp (Sold Out needs 4, Warden needs 3 with R which I don't have untapped — actually Prison is tapped). The Drill's {1} ability is irrelevant. Pass to end turn.\n\
\n\
Opponent at 5 life. I'm at 6. Next turn I untap 6 lands and can cast Vindictive Warden + maybe activate {3} deal 1... Actually Warden's {3} ability deals 1 to each opponent — with 6 lands I could cast Warden ({2}{B/R} = 3) and activate {3} once for 1 damage, putting them at 4. Then attack: they must block Warden with 2 creatures (menace). If they block with Rioter + Colony, both die potentially... Warden 2/3 vs Rioter 3/3 + Colony -1/1: Warden deals 2 to Rioter (Rioter survives with 1 damage... 2/3 deals 2 to Rioter, Rioter 3/3 takes 2, survives; Rioter deals 3 to Warden, Warden dies). Hmm, not great but kills nothing. Alternatively swing with everything: Hawk 1/2 (3/2 if I draw 2), Peddlers 4/4, Hunters 3/4, Warden 2/3, plus crew Drill 5/5 trample (crew 2). They're at 5 — a full swing with Drill is likely lethal if anything connects.\n\
\n\
But careful: they have Rockalanche flashback {5}{G} in graveyard with 3 Forests — they have 6 lands (3 Forest tapped, Swamp, Swamp tapped, Swamp, and... let me count: Forest x3 tapped, Swamp, Swamp tapped, Swamp = 6 lands). So they CAN flashback Rockalanche for {5}{G} to earthbend 3 on a land making a 3/3 haste. That's a potential blocker/attacker.\n\
\n\
Also they have 2 cards in hand. I have Sold Out for instant exile of a creature (only if damaged gives Clue).For now: pass to end turn. Nothing to do with 1 Swamp.",
      "tool_calls": [
