          "name": "choose_action",
          "arguments": "{\"summary\":\"My turn 10 combat resolved: opponent fell to 5 and my lifelink Hunters brought me to 6. Their board: Rioter 3/3, -1/1 Colony, Food, 6 lands, 2 cards. I have 1 untapped Swamp and nothing castable (Sold Out {3}{B}, Warden {2}{B/R} both too expensive). The Drill's {1} anti-hexproof ability is irrelevant. Passing to end my turn; next turn I untap 6 lands for Warden + a full crewed-Drill swing.\",\"choice\":\"no\"}",
