      "chosen_args": {
        "summary": "Turn 4 postcombat: Fatal Fissure's earthbend-4 trigger on Long Feng is live until end of turn. I have two untapped black sources (Boiling Rock Prison + Swamp) and a Clue token. Opponent has Long Feng (their earthbend value engine), a 2/2 earthbent Swamp, Leaves from the Vine at lore 1, and a Food token with one card in hand. Casting Deadly Precision on Long Feng and sacrificing the Clue as the additional cost to destroy it and trigger earthbend 4.",
        "choice": "p39",
        "rationale": "Killing Long Feng now removes their earthbend counter engine AND triggers my Fatal Fissure earthbend 4, turning one of my lands into a 4/4. Sacrificing the Clue token as the additional cost lets me cast it for just {B} while keeping mana open.",
