      "chosen_args": {
        "summary": "Their turn 7: they're pressing while my Drill is tapped, attacking with the 3/3 earthbent Swamp and 3/1 Earth Village Ruffians. The Drill is an uncrewed Vehicle so it can't block. My 1/3 Fortune Teller can block the 3/1 Ruffians, kill it, and survive — and if the Ruffians simply dies in combat, its earthbend-2 death trigger never fires. The Swamp gets through for 3 (11→8), but it returns tapped when it dies so it isn't a recurring threat.",
        "blockers": "p5:p10",
        "rationale": "Blocking the 3/1 Ruffians with my 1/3 Fortune Teller: Teller kills it and survives, and the Ruffians' earthbend-2 trigger only fires if it dies — wait, it dies in combat either way, but blocking denies 3 free damage and removes their attacker. I take 3 from the Swamp (11→8), keeping my Hawk to crew the Drill next turn.",
      },
