      "chosen_args": {
        "summary": "My turn 8: Lost Days tucked their 3/3 earthbent Swamp into their library (no earthbend return) and gave me a Clue token. Their board: untapped Boiling Rock Rioter 3/3, tapped 2/2 earthbent Swamp, Food token, 4 lands, 2 cards in hand. I'm at 3 life with all lands tapped, an untapped Messenger Hawk, untapped 3/3 deathtouch Pirate Peddlers, and an uncrewed Fire Nation Drill.",
        "choice": "no",
        "rationale": "Skipping the attack entirely. At 3 life I can't afford to tap my creatures into their Rioter + 2/2 crackback — attacking with the Drill requires tapping Peddlers to crew, leaving me with no blockers, and they'd kill me on the swing-back. Instead I keep Hawk + Peddlers back: when they attack, I'll crew the Drill with Peddlers to block and kill the Rioter while Hawk chumps the 2/2, keeping me at 3 life with Drill + Peddlers intact to take over the game.",
      },
