      "chosen_args": {
        "summary": "My turn 10 precombat: I'm at 3 life. Opponent has an untapped Boiling Rock Rioter 3/3, a summoning-sick 4/4 flying Buzzard-Wasp Colony, a tapped 2/2 earthbent Swamp, a Food token, 6 lands, and 2 cards in hand. I have 5 untapped lands (Prison B/R, Island, 3 Swamps), a Clue token, Messenger Hawk 1/2, 3/3 deathtouch Pirate Peddlers, Foggy Swamp Hunters 3/4, and the uncrewed Drill. I'm casting Swampsnare Trap ({1}{B} with the flying discount) to give the Colony -5/-3 and kill it before it can attack.",
        "choice": "p70",
        "rationale": "Killing the 4/4 flying Colony is urgent — I'm at 3 life and it attacks for lethal the moment it unsicks. Swampsnare Trap costs only {1}{B} here thanks to the flying discount, leaving me exactly enough mana to also cast Vindictive Warden afterward. Removing it now while it's summoning sick and can't attack is the only safe window.",
      },
