      "chosen_args": {
        "summary": "Swampsnare Trap killed their 4/4 flying Colony (now a -1/1), and I played Airship Engine Room as my land drop. I'm at 3 life with 3 untapped Swamps; their only real creature is Boiling Rock Rioter 3/3. Now I'm cracking my Clue token: it draws my second card of the turn, pumping Messenger Hawk to 3/2, giving Foggy Swamp Hunters lifelink+menace, and putting a +1/+1 counter on Pirate Peddlers (4/4) — setting up a huge attack.",
        "choice": "p78",
        "rationale": "Cracking the Clue before combat is pure value: the second draw of the turn turns Hawk into a 3/2 flyer, gives Hunters lifelink+menace, and grows Peddlers to 4/4. Their two blockers (Rioter 3/3, -1/1 Colony) can't cover flying + menace + deathtouch, so blocks will be disastrous for them.",
      },
