\n\
Boiling Rock Prison produces B, which is useful. It enters tapped, but it also has a late-game sac to draw a card, which synergizes with the \"draw two cards per turn\" theme (Wolfbat, Foggy Swamp Hunters, Otter-Penguin, Messenger Hawk). That's a nice bonus.\n\
\n\
Airship Engine Room produces U/R — U is useful, R is not really.\n\
\n\
