\n\
However, tapped lands can slow the deck. The deck has 1-drops (Corrupt Court Official x3, Deadly Precision, Azula Always Lies, Fatal Fissure) and 2-drops, so it's fairly aggressive. Tapped lands hurt but the duals fix the splash.\n\
\n\
