\n\
Alternatively, just play basics: 3 Island, 14 Swamp. Safe. But the duals add upside with minimal downside since black requirements are heavy and duals make black (Prison) — the main concern is blue. Airship replacing one Island keeps 3 blue sources.\n\
\n\
I'll go with all three dual lands.\n\
